flowchart TB
    Mixins["psi/impl mixins\ngetReference() on composites\nno PsiReferenceContributor"]
    Mixins --> Direct{"direct reference?"}
    Direct -->|variable / call / type| CrystalRef["CrystalReference.resolve()"]
    Direct -->|obj.method / Class.method| DotRef["CrystalDotCallReference.resolve()"]
    Direct -->|A::B::C segment| NsRef["CrystalNamespaceReference\nfull path, else simple name"]

    CrystalRef --> LocalScope["CrystalLocalScopeResolve\nfile-bounded walk:\nassignments + params"]
    LocalScope --> StubIdx["StubIndex\nClassIndex + MethodIndex\nallScope"]
    StubIdx --> Tiebreak["bare-call stdlib tiebreak\nenclosing class preferred\nFile.exists? not Dir.exists?"]
    Tiebreak --> StdlibFB["stdlib fallback"]

    DotRef --> RecvScan["CrystalDotCallReceiver\nprevSibling of dot_call_access\nCONSTANT / namespace /\ninferred ident / self / literal"]
    RecvScan --> Known{"receiver type known?"}
    Known -->|yes, per union member| ByClass["CrystalMethodByClassIndex\nclass name + method filter\nqualified-name disambiguation"]
    Known -->|new| Ctor["constructor order:\ndef self.new > record >\ndef initialize"]
    Known -->|no| ProjFallback["project-only name fallback\nnever stdlib"]
    ByClass --> StdlibFB
    Ctor --> StdlibFB

    StdlibFB --> HomeFile["CrystalStdlibFileResolve\nparse home file only\nClassName to class_name.cr"]
    HomeFile -->|miss| TextScan["CrystalStdlibTextScan\ncached SymbolLoc table\nstdlib root only"]
    TextScan --> Materialize["materialize via VFS+PSI\nevery resolve"]

    CrystalRef --> GotoHandler["CrystalGotoDeclarationHandler\nClassName.new routing\nrequire paths\n@var / @@var targets"]
    DotRef --> GotoHandler
    NsRef --> GotoHandler

    Warmup["CrystalStdlibCacheWarmup\npost-startup daemon"] --> TextScan
